{
  "slug": "math-proof",
  "name": "Math Proof",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Two skills for hard mathematics problems, each ending in a self-contained proof.md: /math-proof:solo has the session work the problem itself in stages with a notes file; /math-proof:siege works on it for hours in rounds of judge and worker sub-agents and says plainly what is and is not proved.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills** and **3 agents**.\n\n- **Skills** (2): `siege` (Work on one hard mathematics problem in rounds: each round a judge writes a few self-contained questions, independent…), `solo` (Work on one hard mathematics problem in this session yourself, with no sub-agents: reason in stages, record each…)\n- **Agents** (3): `math-proof-judge` (The math-proof judge: it plans each round's questions, reads the answers, keeps the summary and ledger, and writes…), `math-proof-worker-deep` (The higher-effort math-proof worker, used from the escalation round on (round 4, unless the siege setting ESC_ROUND says…), `math-proof-worker` (A math-proof worker: it answers one self-contained question from a file, writing its answer to a file as…)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install math-proof@claude-plugins-official` from `anthropics/claude-plugins-official` (`plugins/math-proof`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 2,
    "agent": 3
  },
